+# Independent review: 3aa0828..7192583
+
+Reviewed 2026-10-19, target `7192583c4a86c0c958db1fb83a9a80344947a466`, branch
+`chore/review-main-7192583`. **NO-GO for closing M3: two confirmed P2 defects, seven red acceptance tests.**
+P1: 0; P2: 2; P3: 0. The literal M3 Done-when smoke commands pass, but T3.6 does not meet its data-integrity claim.
+
+## Ranked findings
